{"section":{"id":"cet4-2025-06-set2-passage-3","examId":"cet4-2025-06-set2","title":"短文 3","kind":"短文","start":1237.78,"end":1349.55,"preview":"The vast majority of the UK's 200,000 tons of retail sector's annual food waste comes from supermarkets,","lines":[{"start":1237.78,"end":1246.35,"text":"The vast majority of the UK's 200,000 tons of retail sector's annual food waste comes from supermarkets,"},{"start":1246.35,"end":1251.23,"text":"but it's a problem that impacts independent luxury food suppliers,"},{"start":1251.23,"end":1251.95,"text":"too."},{"start":1251.95,"end":1253.87,"text":"The scale is small."},{"start":1253.87,"end":1259.95,"text":"It's estimated at less than 1% of the UK's food waste total,"},{"start":1259.95,"end":1263.63,"text":"but the quality from these suppliers is high."},{"start":1263.63,"end":1272.67,"text":"Everything from specialist cheeses to sought-after coffee beans gets thrown away every day in the current food system."},{"start":1272.67,"end":1277.23,"text":"This is where French entrepreneur Sophie André comes in."},{"start":1277.23,"end":1282.67,"text":"In 2016, she moved to London and began by setting up a business,"},{"start":1282.67,"end":1286.5,"text":"delivering luxury handmade food across the city."},{"start":1286.5,"end":1289.68,"text":"\"Food delivery seems to be a big thing here,"},{"start":1289.68,"end":1294.43,"text":"\" she says, \"So I started delivering products by bicycle."},{"start":1294.43,"end":1303.39,"text":"Talking with local producers, I learned that a small part of the production is sometimes wasted due to problems with size or shape,"},{"start":1303.39,"end":1307.23,"text":"but the quality of the products remains unchanged.\""},{"start":1307.23,"end":1312.02,"text":"Unlike many food waste projects that have sprung up in recent years,"},{"start":1312.02,"end":1315.27,"text":"the idea is not simply to redistribute waste food,"},{"start":1315.27,"end":1317.95,"text":"but to provide a high-quality product."},{"start":1317.95,"end":1326.02,"text":"André's company, Elysia, offers breakfasts and snacks specifically aimed at business meetings and events."},{"start":1326.02,"end":1330.91,"text":"Once sourced, Elysia uses waste products to create simple,"},{"start":1330.91,"end":1333.87,"text":"natural, straightforward meals and snacks."},{"start":1333.87,"end":1338.11,"text":"Perhaps unlike other waste food, the supply is regular."},{"start":1338.11,"end":1341.95,"text":"Suppliers will always have a certain amount of surplus."},{"start":1341.95,"end":1344.75,"text":"So the menus remain regular, too."},{"start":1344.75,"end":1349.55,"text":"André believes this benefits both her business and her customers."}],"audio":"assets/audio/ef6546fc4525fbe77fac001474ccdaddde4417a30617cb3420ba2ac49208b3ec.wav","audioOffset":1237.78},"tasks":[{"id":"0-0","text":"The vast majority of the UK's 200,000 tons of retail sector's annual food waste comes from supermarkets, but it's a problem that impacts independent luxury food suppliers, too.","start":1237.78,"end":1251.95,"legacyTaskIds":["0-0","1-0","2-0"],"legacyTaskIndices":[0,1,2],"sentenceVisual":{"type":"食物","icon":"utensils","image":"assets/images/a3b4f427ce07cadbc58fe7bbfdaf9a9f0ca39cacd3de17f62209b98cc642c4d1.webp","alt":"食品零售浪费情境"},"chunks":[{"text":"The vast majority of the UK's 200,000 tons of retail sector's annual food waste","start":1237.78,"end":1244.88,"visual":{"type":"食物","icon":"utensils","image":"assets/images/14e053cc58ce77d4018ddc8c5540a75a5350b14458c9ae794c758846fce63405.webp","alt":"超市食品浪费"}},{"text":"comes from supermarkets,","start":1244.88,"end":1246.38,"visual":{"type":"事件","icon":"shapes","image":"assets/images/f4c2d0ad568d956abbcbcdbd3251e21155e3cbcb0bf5e4a5bd095ae86167c8ae.webp","alt":"当前食品系统的场景"}},{"text":"but it's a problem that impacts independent luxury food suppliers, too.","start":1246.38,"end":1251.95,"visual":{"type":"食物","icon":"utensils","image":"assets/images/eb46185782b4e1cfb8c8587c5d34f8e92dabe649f3f4d